# QA M5 relaxed run of the Wolfgangsee (D-045 measurement, M5 acceptance):
# sensible, non-speedrun play by the boat route, walking (no RUN) wherever
# Resi is on her own feet. Lead-in (the side camera, 527 frames, 8.8 s):
# a look around, the two quay Oblaten, the M-box and its Mozartkugel
# (Zuckerschock at 199), the bathing notch lesson (dive for its 3 Oblaten,
# two strokes up, a held jump-out onto the quay piece 16-17; the scroll
# starts at 527), a pause by the „Raddampfer" sign while she drifts onto
# the Dampfer, which leaves. Scroll (4267 frames, fixed): the steamer ride
# at the right clamp (from here identical to wolfgangsee_solver's state at
# its 1053, shifted by 421), the Gschwendt pier, the Seebad with a
# jump-out stomp on swan #2, under the lantern pontoon (checkpoint), then
# the Traundl chain of wolfgangsee_traundl (A, the border raft, Gelse #2
# stomped from the raft, B, C, the perch, Gelse #3 stomped, the Z-box; as
# Zuckerschock she lands on the perch instead of the bollard and the
# Zaunerstollen is lost in the lake, see qa_m5_bug_zaunerstollen_rolls_off_
# bollard), a hop over the perch bollard into the lake and a dive along
# the lake bed under swan #3 and the three regatta boats (bed Oblaten).
# Lead-out (348 frames, 5.8 s): two strokes up in the Strobl shallows, a
# jump-out onto the Strobl quay (6 Oblaten), a short look around, up onto
# the Schiffsstation roof, walking off its end to the Maibaum (100).
# LevelComplete at 5142 = 85.7 s, no hurt, no death, still Zuckerschock.
